l, "cached_tokens": 0, "text_tokens": null, "image_tokens": null}, "extra_tokens_details": {"CacheCreationInputTokens": 32231}}, "service_tier": null}, "total_calls_in_response": 1}, "content": "cd /app/astropy && git commit --author=\"openhands <openhands@all-hands.dev>\" -m \"Fix separability matrix computation for nested CompoundModels\nThe _cstack function was incorrectly setting all values to 1 instead of\npreserving the existing separability matrix when processing nested\ncompound models like Pix2Sky_TAN() & (Linear1D(10) & Linear1D(5)).\nThis fix changes line 245 in separable.py to preserve the computed\nseparability matrix instead of overwriting it with ones.\nIncludes regression test to prevent this issue from reoccurring.\"\n[main 1e556c152] Fix separability matrix computation for nested CompoundModels\n Author: openhands <openhands@all-hands.dev>\n Committer: root <root@rack-ge107-ya-20250517193277.idczw.hb1.kwaidc.com>\nYour name and email address were configured automatically based\non your username and hostname. Please check that they are accurate.\nYou can suppress this message by setting them explicitly. Run the\nfollowing command and follow the instructions in your editor to edit\nyour configuration file:\n\n    git config --global --edit\n\nAfter doing this, you may fix the identity used for this commit with:\n\n    git commit --amend --reset-author\n\n 2 files changed, 43 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)", "extras": {"command": "cd /app/astropy && git commit --author=\"openhands <openhands@all-hands.dev>\" -m \"Fix separability matrix computation for nested CompoundModels\n\nThe _cstack function was incorrectly setting all values to 1 instead of\npreserving the existing separability matrix when processing nested\ncompound models like Pix2Sky_TAN() & (Linear1D(10) & Linear1D(5)).\n\nThis fix changes line 245 in separable.py to preserve the computed\nseparability matrix instead of overwriting it with ones.\n\nIncludes regression test to prevent this issue from reoccurring.\"", "metadata": {"exit_code": 0, "pid": -1, "username": "root", "hostname": "rack-ge107-ya-20250517193277", "working_dir": "/app/astropy", "py_interpreter_path": "/opt/openhands-venv/bin/python", "prefix": "", "suffix": "\n[The command completed with exit code 0.]"}, "hidden": false}, "success": true}
